                  {
                    "value": "About this page · Segment scan (export)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This is not a report page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "It is the export contract. PowerBI/queries/segment_scan.dax defines its grain, its columns and its materiality filter, and tests/test_reconciliation.py compares every cell of it against validation/reference_rule.py, an independent implementation of the same rule written in pandas."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Power BI Desktop has no XMLA endpoint without Premium capacity, so Python cannot query this model directly. The bridge is a file: export this table to data/exports/segment_scan_pbi.csv and the test suite reads it."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Before you touch anything here"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Every measure on this page is formatted as a plain decimal — no percent signs, no currency symbols, no thousands separators. The export writes what is displayed, and a reconciliation that trips over $46,622 is testing the export dialog rather than the model. Changing a format here breaks the test suite."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "It must stay a table, not a matrix. A matrix nests the three key columns into a hierarchy and exports blanks for repeated levels. A table gives one flat row per cell, which is the grain the rule works at."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Totals off. A totals row is not a cell and has nothing to be compared against."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "To produce the export",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Rebuild the database, refresh the model, select the table, Export data → Data with current layout → .csv, save it over data/exports/segment_scan_pbi.csv, then run pytest."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
